  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Match observed m/z peaks to theoretical monoisotopic m/z values of glycan compositions (Hex, HexNAc, Fuc, NeuAc, NeuGc) under a chosen ion model, charge and ppm tolerance, entirely in the browser, and export the ranked matches as CSV. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
